notes.body:
I suppose we could split the preference struct into public and private parts, e.g.

```
// in prefs.h
struct preference {
    const char *name;
    const char *title;
    const char *description;
    struct preference_data *pd;
};

// in prefs.c
struct preference_data {
// everything else
};
```

but that seems like a lot of work just to convert some connections.

